OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies in A1 three-car
OL,4,Acollision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died in a three-car
OL,7,Fcollision on the A1, prompting an
OL,8,Fappeal for information.
OL,10,FNorthumbria Police said a white Nissan
OL,11,FQashqai car was travelling northbound
OL,12,Fon the A1 near Felton, Northumberland,
OL,13,Fwhen it was involved in a crash with a
OL,14,Fred Renault Clio and a white Tesla
OL,15,Ftravelling southbound at about 12:15
OL,16,FBST on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
