OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies in A1 three-car
OL,4,Acollision
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the Clio died at the
OL,7,Fscene. A passenger of the Qashqai
OL,8,Fsuffered serious injuries and was
OL,9,Ftreated in hospital, while the male
OL,10,Fdriver of the Qashqai suffered minor
OL,11,Finjuries.
OL,13,FThe force said it had yet to establish
OL,14,Fhow the crash happened and officers
OL,15,Furged anyone with information or
OL,16,Fdashcam footage to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
